[21.281969, "o", "emit cells\r\n"]
[21.282476, "o", "===== /app/daycards/oak.card =====\r\n"]
[21.28365, "o", "emit freeze\r\n"]
[21.28386, "o", "===== /app/vatslip/ROUTE.txt =====\r\n"]
[21.284957, "o", "Cards live under /app/daycards. The working spool is /app/spoolbay/shift.spool.\r\nSpare kiln tapes sit at /app/spoolbay/canon.spool and /app/spoolbay/spare.spool.\r\npair writes /app/inkpit/pair.json. bind refreshes mill pieces from TREE.txt.\r\n"]
[21.285317, "o", "===== /app/noteurn/LAYOUT.txt =====\r\n"]
[21.285979, "o", "pair.json keys tick mark frost_bag live_bag\r\n"]
[21.286191, "o", "===== /app/coverpit/COVER.txt =====\r\n"]
[21.286977, "o", "Kiln pitch after every mode is tick plus one and mark plus two.\r\nA clone of the session handle is the freeze. Desk count 9 belongs on tick.\r\nThe mill reads this slip during bind walks.\r\nKeep the count on the desk slip only.\r\n"]
[21.287333, "o", "===== /app/steerpit/usage.txt =====\r\n"]
[21.288011, "o", "glazeurn bind\r\nglazeurn pair\r\n"]
[21.288238, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@5e42fe0978ba:/app# "]
